{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜流程图\n只呈现能力从装配、申请到结束的阶段；类和接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]、[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]]。组仲裁 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|子图]] · 伤害 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|子图]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grant",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 状态宿主创建 ASC 与基础属性，并按 AbilitySet 授予 GA / GE。\n\n调用：CombatantState 构造 ASC/属性 → CharacterSlot::InitializeForPawnData(PawnData) → AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 玩家 InputTag 或 Boss ActionTag 形成激活申请。\n\n玩家：HeroComponent::Input_AbilityInputTagPressed(Tag) → ASC::AbilityInputTagPressed；Boss：BTTask_GGYGOActivateAbility::ExecuteTask → ASC::TryActivateAbility(Handle)。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "check",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ASC 检查 Tag、消耗、组规则和优先级。\n详见 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]。\n\n调用：ASC::TryActivateAbility → GA::CanActivateAbility → ASC::IsActivationBlockedByGroup；失败 Tag 写入 OptionalRelevantTags。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. GA 激活：Montage、事件窗口、移动请求与相机接管按能力配置执行。\n\n调用：GA::ActivateAbility → PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent::Activate；事件驱动 Trace，GE/Cue 见伤害子图。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 243,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "拒绝：反馈原因；仅可重试的玩家意图进入缓冲。\n\n调用：ASC::NotifyAbilityFailed → OnAbilityInputRetryable(Tag) → HeroComponent::BufferAbilityInput；非排队失败不缓冲。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 756,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. GA 完成/取消：释放组、撤销相机接管；可能唤醒缓冲请求。\n\n调用：GA::EndAbility → ASC::NotifyAbilityEnded / RemoveAbilityFromActivationGroup → OnAbilityGroupFreed；GA::ClearCameraMode。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 878,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "damage",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "命中分支：GE → 属性 → Cue；详见 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害子图]]。\n\n接口链：Trace::OnMeleeHit → GA::HandleMeleeHit → ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget → DamageExecution::Execute_Implementation。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 1242,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "grant",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "GiveToAbilitySystem → SpecHandle"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "check",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "ProcessAbilityInput / TryActivateAbility"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "check",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "active",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "CanActivateAbility=true → ActivateAbility"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "check",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "fail",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "FailureTags → NotifyAbilityFailed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "active",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "end",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "EndAbility → RemoveAbilityFromActivationGroup"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "active",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "damage",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "OnMeleeHit → ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "end",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "OnAbilityGroupFreed → 重交 InputTag"
    }
  ]
}
